ced news of Greer's death.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gaza: At least 21 dead, including children, in building collapse</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b56d4ce1661d981d66fd2e95e619c42d74e557062d03f2bbb4072bacfcad307</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T15:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gaza-at-least-21-dead-including-children-in-building-collapse/a-79293453--3138d3baf4ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gaza-at-least-21-dead-including-children-in-building-collapse/a-79293453?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The search for survivors has been hampered by Israeli restrictions on heavy machinery in the Gaza Strip. Authorities say 2,000 damaged buildings in the territory are occupied by families who have nowhere else to go.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Forgotten US court of 'secrecy' could mean more deportations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d4d3c6b2e1dd430d9f45c90d4a6a19c6eb90a098566a65533ca987af4035f08c</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:38:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T15:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/forgotten-us-court-of-secrecy-could-mean-more-deportations/a-79291125--0ff5869fb815.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/forgotten-us-court-of-secrecy-could-mean-more-deportations/a-79291125?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The use of a secretive and long dormant court in the deportation of a woman from the US could have significant consequences. The Alien Terrorist Removal Court was just used for the first time in its 30-year history.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>After Neuer: Who will be Germany's new No. 1 goalkeeper?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c76d0c9ba7d5a25d214559b8dcc70e8a0294eca95171e50736f017cc3cec4d93</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:38:10Z</updated><published>2