summary type="html">Although her current world ranking wouldn't allow it, Venus Williams is set to play singles in the US Open – thanks to a wild card. Who gets these coveted spots—and how?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>The great lake divide: Collapse vs. comeback</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:afe654dc6891de436848c0f728c515da0fedabccc383668abc6984c5e2097fd9</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:36:42Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T09:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-great-lake-divide-collapse-vs-comeback/a-78460263--04bbfa728d70.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-great-lake-divide-collapse-vs-comeback/a-78460263?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As some of the world's biggest lakes vanish in real time, others are proving that recovery is still within reach.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Why social media addiction is so hard to regulate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:334c75cda323af3af88b2013735a28a4aa2ff0eeccd07d72b8fbd503b3a01010</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:36:42Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T09:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023--933d64d6576a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Facebook, Instagram and other social media platforms are accused of deliberately fostering addictive behavior among young users. Yet regulators continue to struggle to rein in their engagement-driven business models.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Bundesliga season 2026-27: All you need to know</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:26cdc3119b8cc56932a1bf407988671df0aaff9b799cc33bd5de7dd884a12436</id><updated>2026-09-16T19:36:42Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T06:39:00Z</publish